WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.073
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.123 --> 00:00:06.916
AI for Young Builders, video 12.

3
00:00:06.966 --> 00:00:10.400
Fair AI: when data is unfair.

4
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:18.144
An AI learns exactly what its data teaches it, including the unfair parts.

5
00:00:18.194 --> 00:00:19.940
This is called bias.

6
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:27.426
Imagine a face-unlock AI trained on eighteen adults and only two children.

7
00:00:27.476 --> 00:00:34.747
It works well for adults, ninety-six percent, but only fifty-five percent for children.

8
00:00:34.797 --> 00:00:37.187
Nobody meant it to be unfair.

9
00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:40.300
The data simply had too few children.

10
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:43.605
This has really happened.

11
00:00:43.655 --> 00:00:51.222
Researchers found face recognition systems that made far more mistakes on darker-skinned faces.

12
00:00:51.272 --> 00:00:54.990
Voice assistants struggled with Indian accents.

13
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.400
Companies improved them by collecting more varied data.

14
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.889
Here is a sneaky problem.

15
00:01:02.939 --> 00:01:09.107
This model is ninety-five percent accurate overall, which sounds great.

16
00:01:09.157 --> 00:01:12.698
But for group B it is only sixty percent.

17
00:01:12.748 --> 00:01:18.390
An overall score can hide unfairness, so always check each group.

18
00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.549
So how do we make AI fairer?

19
00:01:22.599 --> 00:01:25.601
Collect data from every group.

20
00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:27.636
Balance the numbers.

21
00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:30.383
Test each group separately.

22
00:01:30.433 --> 00:01:34.860
And always ask: who might this AI leave out?

23
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.625
Let us recap.

24
00:01:37.675 --> 00:01:42.726
Bias means AI treats some people or things unfairly.

25
00:01:42.776 --> 00:01:48.122
Unbalanced data makes a model bad at the smaller group.

26
00:01:48.172 --> 00:01:53.223
Check accuracy for each group, and balance the data.

27
00:01:53.273 --> 00:01:58.030
Next: Responsible AI: privacy, deepfakes and you.
